PARITY MAPPING (web → native; values verified by the executed driver below)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  shell:  <GlassPanel className="p-4 sm:p-6"> wrapping grid|EmptyState
            → TSGlassPanel { VStack { freshnessHeader? ; content } }
