            → HeroRadialGaugeView: Circle track + Circle.trim(0..fill) accent arc
              (rounded cap, -90 rotation, reduce-motion-gated fill-in), centre
              value + unit, label below.
              · Sessions  count        max(count,50)   unit ""    cyan  #00f0ff
              · Energy    round(kWh)    max(kWh,500)    unit kWh   green #10b981
              · TotalCost round(cost)   max(cost,100)   unit $     amber #f59e0b
              · AvgPower  round(kW)     250 (fixed)     unit kW    purple#a855f7
  cost:   $<AnimatedNumber value=parseFloat(fmtNumber(avgCostPerKwh,2)) decimals=3>
            → HeroCostMetricTile: TSAnimatedNumber("$" + 2-then-3-decimal value)
              tinted statusSuccess (emerald) + uppercase tracked label.
  empty:  stats===null → <EmptyState message={t('charging.noStats', …)} />
            → .empty phase → TSEmptyState(title: charging.noStats, bolt.fill).
  fmt:    fmtNumber/fmtInt/formatCurrency (toLocaleString, halfExpand) →
          HeroGaugesFormat.number/integer/currency (NumberFormatter .halfUp, grouped)
          + .round(places:) for the 2-decimal pre-round.
  accent→token (EXACT hex match to apps/design/generated/apple/Tokens.swift):
          cyan→Color.TS.accent · green→statusSuccess · amber→statusWarning ·
          purple→chartSeriesPower (adaptive: light/dark/high-contrast safe).
  i18n:   charging.gauges.{sessions,energy,totalCost,avgPower,avgCostPerKwh} +
          charging.noStats (web parity) + native chrome
          (live/stale/offline/updating/loading/errorTitle/retry), table "HeroGauges".

STATES (every one renders — verified by the ImageRenderer driver [5]):
  loading → HeroGaugesLoadingGrid (5 ring-skeleton tiles; reduce-motion safe)
  content → TSGlassPanel + HeroGaugesGrid (4 gauges + Avg $/kWh)
  empty   → TSEmptyState (web "No charging statistics available yet")
  error   → icon + title + message + Retry → model.refresh()
  stale   → freshness chip (Stale) + ONE guarded auto-refresh; cached gauges stay
  offline → freshness chip (Offline); cached gauges stay, no refetch
a11y: grid container summary (every gauge + cost), per-gauge & per-tile combined
